{
  "name": "dsh-sidebar-cost",
  "version": "0.1.4",
  "description": "侧边栏底部「成本卡片」区:余额/波峰低峰/切换倒计时/近24h话费/预测;数据路由完全自研(内联 Apache-2.0 引擎),零第三方依赖。0.1.4:适配 8-23 周末全天低谷新规,徽章增加工作日/周末提示,余额查询剥离失效代理直连。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": {
      "default": "./lib/client.js"
    },
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml"
  ],
  "license": "Apache-2.0",
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  }
}
